    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 63,
        "text": "What is the primary outcome in your seedling experiment?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "ac014710cb284f51390f3146e9c2093ff8404f3074b028638c11648a18a320bc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 69,
        "sourceEnd": 156,
        "text": "I was going to choose whichever measure shows the largest difference between the lamps.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "15f2eb2e38c49210ea4bb1a6a629f23b4e7d7bb818d9b0f6ed5cb4973ce85947",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 164,
        "sourceEnd": 275,
        "text": "That would make the comparison difficult to interpret. Decide what matters before collecting the final results.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "4b9d1c0a300bdfd50912a80f06edc4503e9379255743681854e4095a03166b63",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 281,
        "sourceEnd": 427,
        "text": "Then our primary measure will be survival after four weeks. Height will be secondary. A tall seedling that dies is not a success for this project.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "bc660e0f933bc6942f01a137fa05f36a3301331374667a2ae59714f8a5f0391c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 435,
        "sourceEnd": 463,
        "text": "How will you count survival?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "96e45f1b06064ae5359a96965672c5d36287930e77ffb70561c77a5b9182980f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 469,
        "sourceEnd": 634,
        "text": "A plant must have at least one green leaf at the final inspection. We will write that definition in the protocol rather than change it after seeing borderline cases.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "1710044141706839d5addc1cff17625c359545b4d9fdc2e8b88cd2dfb6ac3ea8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 642,
        "sourceEnd": 657,
        "text": "How many trays?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "9c744e72a414874d57f23cb654650e12b8e8590281140af31e4f5746e195439a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 663,
        "sourceEnd": 769,
        "text": "Six under each lamp. We will rotate tray positions daily to reduce the effect of being nearest the window.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "3600fddfc3cecf42d42b14984c56caea67d461d99ad8ae45b1153a2940170f67",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 777,
        "sourceEnd": 790,
        "text": "And watering?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "5468d8a2b90b273960b74f5ebf42caa6678712b4bbd587df3b5d5a939c1d76d3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 796,
        "sourceEnd": 943,
        "text": "Equal volumes at the same time each morning. The original proposal said water when needed, but different students could interpret that differently.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "8b07cabbda7368fdf112112e7f8f4ff268084b8c8f8991fb6a1a403f39b177f8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 951,
        "sourceEnd": 1007,
        "text": "What will you do if a tray is accidentally knocked over?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "b95e42c07174006c5173a912a534c0f1feb9b8ad992831b41c42b9784f78051b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1013,
        "sourceEnd": 1173,
        "text": "Record the accident. We will not silently replace its result. The report will explain whether it was excluded and show how that decision affects the comparison.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "5462ac8df5e7774da5ef4f116850a88c784b3b3e302bc2ca729853b1cbb193f7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1181,
        "sourceEnd": 1253,
        "text": "Good. Send the protocol on Friday, before you start the trial on Monday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "363fe95d68ed9b1faf8912010f422c5398acfef5cf1b627a01cb714191c83222",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
